{"seq": 2, "t": 0.00039787503192201257, "type": "schedule", "events": [{"t": 0.0, "what": "You are standing just outside the half-open library door at Twelve Oaks in your green dress, fan in hand, where you can hear the men inside without being seen from the hall. You came here to wait for Ashley Wilkes to come out alone so you can speak to him before the engagement to Melanie is announced tonight. A moment ago a rider came up the drive from Atlanta with word that Fort Sumter has been fired on, and every man in the library has started arguing at once about whether to fight, and Ashley is still in there with them.", "who": ["Scarlett O'Hara"], "kind": "world"}, {"t": 0.0, "what": "A rider from Atlanta has just come up the Twelve Oaks drive with the news that Fort Sumter was fired on, and the men have shut themselves in the library with brandy and cigars to argue about it.", "who": "all", "kind": "world"}, {"t": 130.0, "what": "The argument in the library grows loud enough to carry into the hall, glasses are set down hard, and two of the men come to their feet facing each other across the table.", "who": "all", "kind": "world"}, {"t": 280.0, "what": "Rhett Butler steps out of the shadowed end of the library where he has been listening uninvited, and his presence and open amusement turn the argument personal.", "who": "all", "kind": "world"}, {"t": 400.0, "what": "Voices of the ladies returning to the drawing room are heard across the hall, and Melanie Hamilton passes near the library door looking for Ashley.", "who": "all", "kind": "world"}, {"t": 540.0, "what": "John Wilkes opens the library doors wide and calls the men to join the ladies, where he announces the engagement of Ashley Wilkes and Melanie Hamilton to the whole house.", "who": "all", "kind": "world"}]}
